('stackfood1741612647_cachedata_settings_privacy_policy', 's:3427:\"<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Effective Date: </strong>02/05/2025</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At <strong>Spot2Delivery</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application, website, or services.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>When you interact with Spot2Delivery, we may collect the following types of information:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Personal Information</strong>: Name, phone number, email address, delivery address, and payment details.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Order Information</strong>: Details of food items ordered, preferred restaurants, and order history.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Device Information</strong>: IP address, browser type, device ID, and app usage data.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Location Data</strong>: To ensure accurate delivery, we may collect your real-time location with your permission.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We use your information to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Process and deliver your orders efficiently.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Provide customer support and resolve issues.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Improve our app, services, and user experience.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Send notifications about your orders, offers, and updates.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Comply with legal obligations and prevent fraud.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>3. Sharing of Information</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We do <strong>not sell</strong> your personal data. However, we may share your information with:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Delivery Partners</strong>: To deliver your food to the right location.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Restaurant Partners</strong>: To prepare your order accurately.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Payment Gateways</strong>: To process transactions securely.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Service Providers</strong>: For analytics, customer support, and infrastructure.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Legal Authorities</strong>: When required by law or to enforce our policies.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>4. Data Security</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We implement robust security measures to protect your data from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. Your payment information is encrypted and handled securely by trusted third-party providers.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>5. Your Rights &amp; Choices</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You can:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Access and update your account details at any time.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Opt-out of promotional messages via app settings or email preferences.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Request deletion of your account and personal data by contacting us.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>6. Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Spot2Delivery does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If we become aware of such data, we will delete it promptly.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>7. Changes to This Policy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated date. Continued use of the app indicates your acceptance of the revised policy.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>8. Contact Us</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br />\r\n<strong>support@spot2delivery.com</strong></p>\";', 2105304409),
