('stackfood1741612647_cachedata_settings_terms_and_conditions', 's:3825:\"<h2>Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> [Insert Date]</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Welcome to <strong>Spot2Delivery</strong>! These Terms and Conditions (&quot;Terms&quot;) govern your use of our mobile app, website, and services. By accessing or using Spot2Delivery, you agree to comply with these Terms.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>1. Use of the App</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>You must be <strong>at least 18 years old</strong> to use our services.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>You are responsible for maintaining the <strong>confidentiality of your account credentials</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>You agree to provide <strong>accurate and complete information</strong> during registration and while placing orders.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>2. Orders &amp; Deliveries</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Spot2Delivery acts as a <strong>facilitator</strong> between you and our partner restaurants and delivery agents.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Orders once placed can be <strong>canceled only within a limited time</strong>. Cancellation after food preparation may not be eligible for a full refund.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Delivery times are estimated and may vary due to <strong>traffic, weather, or restaurant load</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>3. Payments</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>All payments must be made using the <strong>available and secure payment methods</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Prices listed include applicable taxes unless otherwise mentioned.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>If a transaction fails but the amount is debited, the issue will be resolved by our <strong>payment gateway partner</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>4. Refunds &amp; Cancellations</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Refunds are issued only when approved by the <strong>admin team</strong>, and processed within <strong>1&ndash;3 business days</strong>.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Users must submit a refund request through the app with appropriate reasons and proof (if required).</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Refer to our <strong>Refund Policy</strong> for full details.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>5. User Conduct</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You agree not to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Misuse the app or use it for illegal purposes.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Harass, threaten, or abuse any customer, delivery partner, or restaurant staff.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Attempt to reverse-engineer or hack the app or its systems.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>6. Intellectual Property</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>All content on Spot2Delivery &mdash; including logos, designs, text, images, and software &mdash; is the <strong>property of Spot2Delivery</strong> and protected by copyright laws. You may not use our brand or materials without permission.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>7. Third-Party Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Spot2Delivery may contain links or integrations with third-party services (e.g., payment gateways). We are not responsible for their content, privacy policies, or actions.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>8. Limitation of Liability</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Spot2Delivery is not liable for:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Food quality issues (handled by restaurants directly).</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Delivery delays due to factors beyond our control.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the service.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>9. Termination</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We reserve the right to <strong>suspend or terminate your account</strong> at any time if you violate these Terms or misuse the platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>10. Changes to Terms</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We may modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting. Continued use of the app means you accept the updated Terms.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>11. Contact Us</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>For questions or support, please contact us:<br />\r\n📧 <strong>support@spot2delivery.com</strong></p>\";', 2105304409);
